<%@ page contentType="text/html;charset=UTF-8" %><%@ include file="../common/header.jspf" %><section class="page-intro compact"><p class="eyebrow">SAVED PLANTS</p><h1>我的收藏</h1><p>收藏的植物条目会保存在您的账户中。</p></section><c:choose><c:when test="${empty plants}"><div class="empty-state"><div class="empty-symbol">☆</div><h3>收藏夹还是空的</h3><p>浏览植物详情并点击收藏，之后可在此快速返回。</p><a class="button secondary" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/plants">查找植物</a></div></c:when><c:otherwise><div class="plant-grid"><c:forEach items="${plants}" var="p"><a class="plant-card" href="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/plant?id=${p.id}"><div class="plant-card-image"><c:choose><c:when test="${not empty p.imageStoredName}"><img src="${pageContext.request.contextPath}/image/${p.imageStoredName}" alt=""></c:when><c:otherwise><div class="image-placeholder">✳</div></c:otherwise></c:choose></div><div class="plant-card-body"><span class="taxonomy"><c:out value="${p.familyZh}" default="暂无科名"/> · <c:out value="${p.genusZh}" default="暂无属名"/></span><h3><c:out value="${p.nameZh}"/></h3><i><c:out value="${p.scientificName}" default="暂无学名"/></i></div></a></c:forEach></div></c:otherwise></c:choose><%@ include file="../common/footer.jspf" %>
